{"id":"npc:%E6%B5%AE%E5%A3%AB%E5%BE%B7","profile":[{"title":"人物简介","text":"本名萨沙，整合运动干部，源石技艺可用于伪装。为了梅菲斯特自愿成为感染者，两人一同加入了整合运动。带领着幻影弩手参与了袭击龙门的行动，通过故意被龙门近卫局俘虏的方式潜入了近卫局大楼，和赶来的梅菲斯特会合攻占了近卫局。最后在楼顶被击溃。看到梅菲斯特对待感染者同胞的态度后对活下去感到心灰意冷，自愿为了掩护梅菲斯特及幻影弩手撤离而在龙门丧生。","spoiler":true,"source":"主线剧情0-10 困境、5-10 长夜终尽、6-6 别说过去的事、6-7 断弦等。"}],"artCandidates":[{"kind":"avg","url":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avg_npc_085.png","verified":true,"spoiler":true,"thumbnailUrl":"https://media.prts.wiki/thumb/1/12/Avg_avg_npc_085.png/240px-Avg_avg_npc_085.png"},{"kind":"avg","url":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1d/Avg_char_1508_Faust_1.png","verified":true,"spoiler":true,"thumbnailUrl":"https://media.prts.wiki/thumb/1/1d/Avg_char_1508_Faust_1.png/240px-Avg_char_1508_Faust_1.png"}],"appearances":[{"story":"obt/main/level_main_00-10_beg","lineCount":3,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":20,"line":21,"speaker":"浮士德","text":"……"},{"commandIndex":46,"line":47,"speaker":"浮士德","text":"————！"},{"commandIndex":70,"line":71,"speaker":"浮士德","text":"……！"}]},{"story":"obt/main/level_main_00-11_end","lineCount":3,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":87,"line":88,"speaker":"浮士德","text":"对不起……我失手了。"},{"commandIndex":94,"line":95,"speaker":"浮士德","text":"……明白了。"},{"commandIndex":98,"line":99,"speaker":"浮士德","text":"……好。"}]},{"story":"obt/main/level_main_05-09_end","lineCount":5,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":15,"line":16,"speaker":"浮士德","text":"明白。"},{"commandIndex":242,"line":243,"speaker":"浮士德","text":"用剑锋偏移了弩弹？"},{"commandIndex":272,"line":273,"speaker":"浮士德","text":"……"}]},{"story":"obt/main/level_main_05-10_beg","lineCount":12,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":29,"line":30,"speaker":"浮士德","text":"我知道。"},{"commandIndex":171,"line":172,"speaker":"浮士德","text":"（梅菲斯特，按照计划，现在射击她，她必须中断施术，或者，她 会在爆炸中死去。）"},{"commandIndex":660,"line":661,"speaker":"浮士德","text":"……是。"}]},{"story":"obt/main/level_main_05-10_end","lineCount":26,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":19,"line":20,"speaker":"浮士德","text":"唔。"},{"commandIndex":158,"line":159,"speaker":"浮士德","text":"这次和切尔诺伯格不同。我们没有切断对方的通讯，敌人有大量援军，抵抗很激烈。"},{"commandIndex":313,"line":314,"speaker":"浮士德","text":"跳！我会拉住你！"}]},{"story":"obt/main/level_main_06-01_beg","lineCount":7,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":105,"line":106,"speaker":"浮士德","text":"……"},{"commandIndex":107,"line":108,"speaker":"浮士德","text":"（如果对手只有普通警力和龙门近卫局，以及罗德岛，我们一定能安全撤退。）"},{"commandIndex":124,"line":125,"speaker":"浮士德","text":"（……）"}]},{"story":"obt/main/level_main_06-03_beg","lineCount":22,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":7,"line":8,"speaker":"浮士德","text":"梅菲斯特？"},{"commandIndex":8,"line":9,"speaker":"浮士德","text":"你刚才释放了什么法术？你的……队伍，比之前更狂躁了。"},{"commandIndex":169,"line":170,"speaker":"浮士德","text":"快走！牧群的目标是你们！"}]},{"story":"obt/main/level_main_06-03_end","lineCount":37,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":9,"line":10,"speaker":"浮士德","text":"……"},{"commandIndex":114,"line":115,"speaker":"浮士德","text":"多数人只是盲从，他们会退缩，也会颤抖。他们并不真依赖谁，他们只是没有开始思考。"},{"commandIndex":167,"line":168,"speaker":"浮士德","text":"……而我已经，没有任何办法了。"}]},{"story":"obt/main/level_main_06-05_end","lineCount":10,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":191,"line":192,"speaker":"浮士德","text":"穿黑色雨披的人。"},{"commandIndex":197,"line":198,"speaker":"浮士德","text":"弩手们，调整现在的队伍！我和其他小队吸引了许多梅菲斯特的队员。"},{"commandIndex":226,"line":227,"speaker":"浮士德","text":"控制住他。"}]},{"story":"obt/main/level_st_06-01","lineCount":64,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":8,"line":9,"speaker":"萨沙","text":"理想？"},{"commandIndex":45,"line":46,"speaker":"萨沙","text":"可是，这里既没有吃的，也没有可以住的地方，这里只是……只是下水道。"},{"commandIndex":302,"line":303,"speaker":"浮士德","text":"但我们可以一起活下去。"}]},{"story":"obt/main/level_main_06-06_beg","lineCount":34,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":190,"line":191,"speaker":"浮士德","text":"向贫民区方向突破。虽然我们没有弑君者的音信……但贫民区依然是我们唯一的出口。"},{"commandIndex":252,"line":253,"speaker":"浮士德","text":"弩手们，我相信霜星正在赶往这里。虽然弑君者下落不明，但她的部队说不定还在龙门贫民区之内。"},{"commandIndex":285,"line":286,"speaker":"浮士德","text":"别了，伊诺。"}]},{"story":"obt/main/level_main_08-06_end","lineCount":6,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":122,"line":123,"speaker":"萨沙","text":"不可以用法术！"},{"commandIndex":124,"line":125,"speaker":"萨沙","text":"你，你快点走开！我们只是从矿场里拿了些东西……我们不想杀人！"},{"commandIndex":152,"line":153,"speaker":"萨沙","text":"你……"}]},{"story":"obt/main/level_main_08-08_end","lineCount":8,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":115,"line":116,"speaker":"萨沙","text":"……为什么这么问？"},{"commandIndex":136,"line":137,"speaker":"萨沙","text":"那我到底该叫你什么？你这么说，我不知道该怎么叫你了。"},{"commandIndex":155,"line":156,"speaker":"萨沙","text":"可你在杀坏人。你在和他们战斗。"}]},{"story":"obt/memory/story_swllow_1_1","lineCount":5,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":532,"line":533,"speaker":"浮士德","text":"只听从命令，一昧依赖别人的想法行动，最后会变成可怕的模样。"},{"commandIndex":536,"line":537,"speaker":"浮士德","text":"多数人只是盲从，他们会退缩，也会颤抖。他们并不真依赖谁，他们只是没有开始思考。"},{"commandIndex":542,"line":543,"speaker":"浮士德","text":"你经历的还不够多。"}]}]}